Package: parrot-lab
Version: 0.3.0-1
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Parrot Lab contributors
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.43), libstdc++6, libswiftlang (>= 6.1.3), libqt6core6t64 (>= 6.10), libqt6gui6 (>= 6.10), libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.10), qt6-qpa-plugins, qt6-wayland, libgstreamer1.0-0, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-libav
Recommends: ffmpeg
Description: Experimental Bebop and Jumping Sumo telemetry and video desktop
 Native Swift, Qt 6 Widgets and GStreamer bench application for Ubuntu 26.04.
 Includes telemetry, H.264/MJPEG preview, basic Sumo driving and raw recording.
 This initial Linux port does not include flight controls or device installers.
